{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach and take it, then move to goal location, else scan and move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTasks    /> <Condition ID = IsLocationReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    />",
